  "title": "CityRhythm",
  "description": "<p>CityRhythm is an interactive map of how a city breathes through the week: footfall, demographics, places, local climate and a sound layer that turns the mood of each part of the city into music. Data cover the Comune di Ascoli Piceno.</p>",
